      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_Ridge%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area’s first families were largely Presbyterians, Quakers, or Northern Baptists, reflecting the region’s religious diversity.",
